flowchart TD
  Need[Current automatic request and real available cargo] --> Candidate[Same returned driven Parked hull]
  Candidate --> Handling{Unfinished physical fuel job?}
  Handling -->|Yes| Wait[Keep Parked and existing fuel custody]
  Handling -->|No| Preview[Reuse Dispatch trip calculation with intended cargo and actual tank]
  Preview --> Fuel{Actual tank covers trip and existing reserve?}
  Fuel -->|No| Wait
  Wait --> Worker[Existing M08 pickup carry and tank handoff]
  Worker --> Wake[Existing committed-state wake]
  Wake --> Candidate
  Fuel -->|Yes| Accept[Same synchronous command calls existing accept]
  Accept --> Physical[Existing manifest loading departure HQ unload and return]
  Physical --> Candidate
